{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16658","headline":"歌 · 陆羽","name":"歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不羡黄金罍，不羡白玉杯。\n不羡朝入省，不羡暮入台。\n惟羡西江水，曾向金陵城下来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「歌」条，撰者管遗瑞、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"管遗瑞"}